ks/407279","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjQ3OTQ3NiJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=c44550c0c00f78be"},{"ObjectID":416225,"Title":"Jingdezhen Imperial Kiln Museum, Jingdezhen, Jiangxi, China","Artist":"Zhu Pei","Date":"2016–2020","Medium":"Pencil on paper","CreditLine":"Gift of Zhu Pei","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/416225","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjUyMzI0NyJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=10479d3dfb6c2a17"},{"ObjectID":422189,"Title":"Makeup Dpt. from the portfolio Artists & Photographs","Artist":"Edward Ruscha","Date":"1975","Medium":"Dye-transfer print on acetate","CreditLine":"Gift of Marian Goodman","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/422189","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjQ5OTMyOSJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=debfc95d15375c06"},{"ObjectID":424177,"Title":"The Johnstone Album","Artist":"Agnes Caroline Chamberlayne Johnstone","Date":"1868-84","Medium":"Album of collaged albumen silver prints with watercolor and ink","CreditLine":"Gift of Agnes Gund in honor of David Dechman","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/424177","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjUwMjY4NiJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=5a6a185f98644f70"},{"ObjectID":434117,"Title":"La chèvre-feuille (The Honeysuckle)","Artist":"Pablo Picasso","Date":"Published 1943; additional materials c. 1943; rebound 1970","Medium":"Book with one etching and engraving (Deux baigneuses, frontispiece) and five relief halftones (after etchings); letterpress text and prière d’insérer; a supplementary suite of eighteen relief halftones (the same six images in three color variants); a second supplementary suite of twenty-nine [thirty] etching and engravings (the frontispiece in four color variants and the five additional images each in five color variants); three publisher’s original paper covers, one for the book and one for each suite. Rebound with additional materials: complete handwritten manuscript by Hugnet tipped in on individual leaves; two drafts of the prière d’insérer by Éluard, one handwritten and one typewritten, both with annotations; two complete sets of galley proofs of the text on newsprint, one with corrections by Hugnet in ink and pencil, one the final proofs; third supplementary suite of the first states of the six relief halftones. Bespoke rebinding, slipcase, and chemise by Mercher. Rebinding: covers of full green goat leather over boards; foil-stamped title on spine; pink calf-leather doublures and flyleaves; pink silk endbands","CreditLine":"Gift of Helen and Sam Zell","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/434117","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjYxNDgxMyJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=0863ff7686675942"},{"ObjectID":437099,"Title":"Untitled 26 from ZZYZX","Artist":"Gregory Halpern","Date":"2016","Medium":"Inkjet print","CreditLine":"Samuel J. Wagstaff, Jr. Fund","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/437099","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjUyODM3NyJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=54842516738efa0a"},{"ObjectID":468907,"Title":"Ashanti stool","Artist":"Jomo Tariku","Date":"2024","Medium":"Birch plywood","CreditLine":"Committee on Architecture and Design Funds","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/468907","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjU5NDg2OSJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=510b09459ea75a9f"},{"ObjectID":469901,"Title":"Untitled (Salvador Dalí's Birthday Party)","Artist":"Jay DeFeo","Date":"May 11, 1973","Medium":"Gelatin silver print chemigram","CreditLine":"Gift of The Jay DeFeo Foundation","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/469901","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjU3ODE1NiJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEw